{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301440","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301440","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130144001:1":{"text":"네. 사막을 다니는 상단들이 며칠째 계속 시련 얘기만 하고 있어요.","source_cn":"是的，那些路过的商队这几天一直在说试炼的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x509D1B7B2CA5710E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130144002:1":{"text":"무시무시한 붉은 모래 거미 지역에 무수히 많은 거미라니... 듣기만 해도 너무 위험할 거 같아요.","source_cn":"恐怖的赤沙蛛域，数不尽的蜘蛛……只是听着就觉得危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC84411AB0C85BC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130144003:1":{"text":"이런 시련이 아직 두 개나 더 남았다는 생각에 걱정이 이만저만이 아니에요.","source_cn":"一想到这样的考验还有两个，我就更担心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC2DB262892760C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血瑟拉芬":{"text":"세라핀","source":"小蛮血瑟拉芬","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}